---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const title = 'Disclaimer';
const description =
  'Website disclaimer for Purinton Analytics: informational content only, no legal advice, and no expert engagement until a conflict check and written agreement.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/disclaimer/">
  <div class="container content-narrow">
    <Breadcrumbs
      crumbs={[
        { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
        { name: 'Disclaimer', path: '/disclaimer/' },
      ]}
    />
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This website is informational. Reading it, or submitting a form through it, does not
      create an engagement with the firm and does not create any professional relationship.
    </p>

    <h2>No legal advice</h2>
    <p>
      Purinton Analytics is not a law firm and nothing on this website is legal advice.
      Content describing litigation procedure, expert disclosure practice, or evidentiary
      standards is descriptive background written for retaining counsel. Attorneys and
      litigants should rely on their own legal judgment and the law of their jurisdiction.
    </p>

    <h2>No engagement without a conflict check and written agreement</h2>
    <p>
      Submitting the conflict check form requests a conflict screen; it does not retain the
      firm, does not obligate the firm to accept the matter, and does not obligate counsel to
      proceed. An engagement exists only after the conflict check clears and a written
      agreement is executed. Until then, do not send confidential case materials.
    </p>

    <h2>No professional advice for specific situations</h2>
    <p>
      General descriptions of vocational evaluation, life care planning, and economic damages
      methodology on this site are not opinions about any specific person or case. Expert
      opinions are formed only within an engagement, from case-specific records, and are
      stated in signed reports and testimony.
    </p>

    <h2>Independent economist partners</h2>
    <p>
      Forensic economic analyses described on this site are performed and signed by
      independent economist partners coordinated by the firm. Descriptions of economic
      methodology are informational and are not economist opinions of the firm or its
      principal.
    </p>

    <h2>Results depend on the case</h2>
    <p>
      Descriptions of the firm's experience, methodology, and prior work do not predict or
      guarantee the outcome of any matter. Every opinion depends on the records, facts, and
      law of the specific case, and results vary.
    </p>

    <h2>External sources</h2>
    <p>
      This site cites and links to external sources, including government data series and
      professional organizations. Those materials belong to their publishers, may change
      after the date they were cited, and are outside the firm's control.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this disclaimer can be directed to
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or
      <a href={`tel:${SITE.phoneE164}`}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
